{"data":[{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2025-08-19T14:28:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1957811886151303599"],"id":"1957811886151303599","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":88657,"like_count":129,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":16,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我再也不敢群发我的黑b了，每次发都会收到一条身经百战的黑狗屌，感觉隔着屏幕我都要被玩坏了，真约线下的话，你不怕你们的黑狗要抹上杏仁露吗？","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1957811886151303599"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2025-08-19T02:05:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1957624997779996984"],"id":"1957624997779996984","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":78915,"like_count":116,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":49,"retweet_count":0},"text":"为什么我前夫可以这么贱，离了婚后还一直pua我。","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1957624997779996984"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2025-08-18T14:21:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1957447749798162758"],"id":"1957447749798162758","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":66411,"like_count":92,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":24,"retweet_count":0},"text":"香港又是黑雨的一天，我的黑b要发霉了。","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1957447749798162758"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2025-08-17T15:36:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1957104334467993968"],"id":"1957104334467993968","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":90588,"like_count":149,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":36,"retweet_count":0},"text":"说我黑是吧，那我更新签名吧。以前的签名叫粤B宝妈，现在改名为黑b宝妈好了。","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1957104334467993968"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2025-08-17T13:58:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1957079668835897641"],"id":"1957079668835897641","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":79181,"like_count":84,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":16,"retweet_count":0},"text":"大号开始更新了，是今天拍的一个笔照，小奶狗拍的。","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1957079668835897641"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2025-08-17T06:12:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1956962273152639422"],"id":"1956962273152639422","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":84582,"like_count":101,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":0},"text":"加钟了，延迟到3点退房，还可以玩一个小时。","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1956962273152639422"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2025-08-16T14:50:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1956730191621112004"],"id":"1956730191621112004","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":70132,"like_count":105,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":28,"retweet_count":0},"text":"他射第三次的时候已经一滴都不剩了，但我感觉我还能玩个半个小时诶，咋办？挺急的，在线等人来接力。","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1956730191621112004"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2025-08-16T10:33:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1956665511896588659"],"id":"1956665511896588659","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":73592,"like_count":88,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":27,"retweet_count":0},"text":"刚才饭后给小奶狗喂了半瓶六味帝王丸，希望他今晚能多搞半个小时。","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1956665511896588659"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2025-08-14T16:29:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1956030419171709154"],"id":"1956030419171709154","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":9,"impression_count":116033,"like_count":165,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":67,"retweet_count":0},"text":"如果在这个推特我跟我那个臭名昭著的前夫复更，你们还会看吗？还是对我失望了？","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1956030419171709154"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2025-08-14T09:33:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1955925811082494065"],"id":"1955925811082494065","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":9,"impression_count":94133,"like_count":183,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":25,"retweet_count":1},"text":"香港黑雨，人还在办公室，想做爱了。 https://t.co/01geymVT1l","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1955925811082494065"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2025-08-13T14:53:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1955643913076658254"],"id":"1955643913076658254","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":20,"impression_count":179806,"like_count":176,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":91,"retweet_count":3},"text":"这种男人就是藏在哪里呢？就是那种很有少年感的大叔，身材保持得不错，一点也不油腻，内心充满阳光，待人真诚，还带着那种知世故而不世故的感觉。究竟藏在哪里？","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1955643913076658254"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2025-08-12T16:36:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1955307347439653038"],"id":"1955307347439653038","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":21,"impression_count":337137,"like_count":215,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":27,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我知道他还是爱我的，就是那次跟鸽子的三人行，他在操鸽子的时候还会向我投来关切的眼神，像在祈求我的同意。现在回看那些照片，我还是挺怀念那时的疯狂。","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1955307347439653038"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2025-08-12T12:30:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1955245410869752150"],"id":"1955245410869752150","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":80861,"like_count":113,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":33,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我最终还是没有狠下心来，给前夫借了10万。就当是为了孩子吧。","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1955245410869752150"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2025-08-11T13:26:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1954897222681911729"],"id":"1954897222681911729","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":93,"impression_count":354427,"like_count":742,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":34,"retweet_count":8},"text":"那些年，与前夫的所作所为，热闹又荒诞\n现在做什么事都是一个人，难得清净但又无尽空虚 https://t.co/1kEQvYESKK","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1954897222681911729"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2025-08-11T09:50:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1954842794511483050"],"id":"1954842794511483050","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":74409,"like_count":131,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":20,"retweet_count":0},"text":"灵魂契合+生理上的喜欢，是上天在漫长的人生中仅有一次的馈赠。我曾经有过，但现在没有了。","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1954842794511483050"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2025-08-10T14:36:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1954552440063508607"],"id":"1954552440063508607","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":156703,"like_count":116,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":50,"retweet_count":0},"text":"前夫问借钱，今年第二次了，借or不借？","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1954552440063508607"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2025-08-10T07:09:36.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1954439976470434097"],"id":"1954439976470434097","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":15,"impression_count":104843,"like_count":206,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":28,"retweet_count":3},"text":"昨晚是跟香港一个曾经身家上亿的粉丝打麻将，我们21年的时候在推特认识的。那时他真的风光，在香港深圳都持有物业，他一直对我很好，做爱也很厉害。今次见他觉得他的状态没有之前好了，一问才知道原来他已经在香港申请破产。这件事刷新了我对财富与成功的认知，在这一波经济冲击里，富豪也难独善其身。","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1954439976470434097"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2025-08-09T14:59:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1954195739489534431"],"id":"1954195739489534431","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":68233,"like_count":83,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":24,"retweet_count":1},"text":"今晚抓住休假的尾巴，挑战裸身打麻将。","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1954195739489534431"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2025-08-09T04:22:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1954035587855659055"],"id":"1954035587855659055","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":61783,"like_count":56,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":0},"text":"回到香港了，又要开始做任人鱼肉的牛马了🥹","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1954035587855659055"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2025-08-08T16:44:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1953859826770964689"],"id":"1953859826770964689","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":100101,"like_count":48,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":18,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1953832325193822411","type":"quoted"}],"text":"这坑妻的货又打算卖视频了？ https://t.co/WVXC3e5dUR","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1953859826770964689"},{"author_id":"153457162906149